(text "BUCK - MP8795H  |  Monolithic Power Systems  |  4-16V 20A synchronous buck, QFN-21 3x4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3af686e5-f55d-4f0e-b992-bd89b81db9e2"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "87c55cd8-70fd-4f92-ad1d-000b4636edae"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - MP8795H (MPS MP8795H Rev1.0, Application Information)\nDesign point: VIN 12 V nom (6-16 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 20 A, fSW 600 kHz (MODE = GND), forced CCM\nFB (Eq.3): RFB2 = VREF/(VOUT-VREF)*RFB1, RFB1 = 20k, VREF 0.6 V -> RFB2 = 4.42k ; VOUT = 3.315 V\nCFF (Eq.4): fZ = 1/(2pi*RFB1*CFF) in 20-60 kHz -> CFF = 220 pF, fZ = 36 kHz\nMODE: GND = 600 kHz ; 30.1k = 800 kHz ; 60.4k = 1 MHz (Table 1)\nInductor (Eq.14): L = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(fSW*dIL), dIL = 30% of 20 A -> 0.665 uH -> 0.68 uH XAL1010-681ME\n  dIL = 5.86 A ; ILP (Eq.15) = IOUT + dIL/2 = 22.9 A\nCurrent limit (Eq.2): RCS = VOCP/(GCS*(ILIM - dIL/2)), VOCP 1.2 V, GCS 10uA/A, ILIM 25 A -> RCS = 5.49k\nSoft-start (Eq.1): CSS(nF) = tSS(ms)*36uA/0.6V ; CSS1+CSS2 = 22n+100n -> tSS = 2.03 ms (min 1 ms internal)\nEN (Eq.5): VIN_START = 1.22*(RUP+RDOWN)/RDOWN ; RDOWN 100k, RUP = 383k (house-common) -> VIN_START = 5.89 V ; VEN @16 V = 3.31 V (<3.6 V)\nInput cap (Eq.7-9): ICIN = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) ; dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN)\nVCC 2.2uF (>=1uF); BST 0.1uF; PGOOD 10k to VOUT (<3.6 V); VSNS- to GND at COUT (remote sense optional)\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=12V nom / 16V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=20A, fSW=600kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.275\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 5.86A @nom, 6.42A @max  (32% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 23.21A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 25A (RCS limit) + dIL/2  (XAL1010-681ME: ISAT 46A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 8.93A (max IOUT/2 = 10.00A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 166mV with CIN_eff=40uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 4.4mV with COUT_eff=280uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 344ns vs tON_MIN(max)=50ns -> OK\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 110.0V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 4.82V\nIC THERMAL (datasheet Typical Performance curves)\n  Efficiency curve (12 VIN, 800 kHz): 94% @5 V, 91% @2.5 V, 20 A -> ~92.5% @3.3 V ; PLOSS = 66W(1/0.925-1) = 5.4 W total\n  Thermal curve (800 kHz, no airflow, EVB): case ~105C @5 V and ~83C @2.5 V at 20 A, TA 25C -> ~90C @3.3 V\n  => case rise ~65C at 20 A: TA(max) ~ 60C at full load without airflow ; use EVB-class 6-layer 2oz copper + vias,\n     derate to ~16 A at 85C ambient or add airflow / heatsink. Inductor DCR loss = 0.31 W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d76d52eb-dd01-4b42-a5e3-18c80216ed4d"))
